    "text": "Radio Iowa\nwebsite\nSioux City\nState Senator De Witt dies after long cancer battle\nBy Kay Henderson,\n1 hours agoA state senator from the Sioux City area has died of cancer at the age of 66. Rocky De Witt, a Republican from Lawton, worked for MidAmerican Energy for 22 years. He was elected to the Iowa Senate in 2022 after serving six years on the Woodbury County Board of Supervisors.",
